Sources for `capture-rule` skill:

- Original to void-harness. No external precedent for this exact mechanism.
- Inspiration: Boris Cherny "how Boris uses Claude Code" (compound engineering loop) + Kieran Klaassen (EveryInc compound-engineering-plugin) — adapted with HITL strict gating.
- Composes with `harness-evolution` (cross-project promotion) and `commit-discipline` (the captured rule is committed with chore(doctrine): or docs(doctrine):).

Strategy: original.

Design constraint: NO auto-write into doctrine ever. The user is the loop closer. Section 0bis.4 of plans/2026-05-29-void-harness-design.md.
